{"page":281,"verses":[{"verse_key":"16:119","surah":16,"ayah":119,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ إِنَّ رَبَّكَ لِلَّذِينَ عَمِلُوا۟ ٱلسُّوٓءَ بِجَهَـٰلَةٍ ثُمَّ تَابُوا۟ مِنۢ بَعْدِ ذَٰلِكَ وَأَصْلَحُوٓا۟ إِنَّ رَبَّكَ مِنۢ بَعْدِهَا لَغَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But towards those who do wrong out of ignorance, and afterwards repent and make amends, your Lord is most forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَبَّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbaka","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"to those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"did","transliteration":"ʿamilū","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلسُّوٓءَ","en_gloss":"evil","transliteration":"l-sūa","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِجَهَـٰلَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"in ignorance","transliteration":"bijahālatin","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَابُوا۟","en_gloss":"repented","transliteration":"tābū","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَأَصْلَحُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and corrected themselves ","transliteration":"wa-aṣlaḥū","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":15,"ar":"رَبَّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbaka","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after that","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بَعْدِهَا","en_gloss":"after that","transliteration":"baʿdihā","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":18,"ar":"لَغَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) surely Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"laghafūrun","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":19,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"16:119"},{"pos":20,"ar":"١١٩","en_gloss":"(119)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:119"}]},{"verse_key":"16:120","surah":16,"ayah":120,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ كَانَ أُمَّةً قَانِتًا لِّلَّهِ حَنِيفًا وَلَمْ يَكُ مِنَ ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Abraham was truly an example: devoutly obedient to God and true in faith. He was not an idolater;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"16:120"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"16:120"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"16:120"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أُمَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"a nation","transliteration":"ummatan","verse_key":"16:120"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَانِتًۭا","en_gloss":"obedient","transliteration":"qānitan","verse_key":"16:120"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِّلَّهِ","en_gloss":"to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"16:120"},{"pos":7,"ar":"حَنِيفًۭا","en_gloss":"upright","transliteration":"ḥanīfan","verse_key":"16:120"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَمْ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walam","verse_key":"16:120"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَكُ","en_gloss":"he was","transliteration":"yaku","verse_key":"16:120"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"16:120"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_gloss":"the polytheists","transliteration":"l-mush'rikīna","verse_key":"16:120"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٢٠","en_gloss":"(120)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:120"}]},{"verse_key":"16:121","surah":16,"ayah":121,"ar_uthmani":"شَاكِرًا لِّأَنْعُمِهِ ۚ ٱجْتَبَىٰهُ وَهَدَىٰهُ إِلَىٰ صِرَٰطٍ مُّسْتَقِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"he was thankful for the blessings of God who chose him and guided him to a straight path.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"شَاكِرًۭا","en_gloss":"Thankful","transliteration":"shākiran","verse_key":"16:121"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِّأَنْعُمِهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"for His favors","transliteration":"li-anʿumihi","verse_key":"16:121"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱجْتَبَىٰهُ","en_gloss":"He chose him","transliteration":"ij'tabāhu","verse_key":"16:121"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَهَدَىٰهُ","en_gloss":"and guided him","transliteration":"wahadāhu","verse_key":"16:121"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"16:121"},{"pos":6,"ar":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","en_gloss":"the way","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","verse_key":"16:121"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","en_gloss":"straight","transliteration":"mus'taqīmin","verse_key":"16:121"},{"pos":8,"ar":"١٢١","en_gloss":"(121)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:121"}]},{"verse_key":"16:122","surah":16,"ayah":122,"ar_uthmani":"وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا حَسَنَةً ۖ وَإِنَّهُۥ فِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ لَمِنَ ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We gave him blessings in this world, and he is among the right-eous in the Hereafter.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"And We gave him","transliteration":"waātaynāhu","verse_key":"16:122"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"16:122"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"16:122"},{"pos":4,"ar":"حَسَنَةًۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"ḥasanatan","verse_key":"16:122"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَإِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"and indeed, he","transliteration":"wa-innahu","verse_key":"16:122"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"16:122"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"16:122"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَمِنَ","en_gloss":"(he) will surely (be) among","transliteration":"lamina","verse_key":"16:122"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","en_gloss":"the righteous","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥīna","verse_key":"16:122"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٢٢","en_gloss":"(122)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:122"}]},{"verse_key":"16:123","surah":16,"ayah":123,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ أَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْكَ أَنِ ٱتَّبِعْ مِلَّةَ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ حَنِيفًا ۖ وَمَا كَانَ مِنَ ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Then We revealed to you [Muhammad], ‘Follow the creed of Abraham, a man of pure faith who was not an idolater.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"16:123"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"We revealed","transliteration":"awḥaynā","verse_key":"16:123"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"16:123"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَنِ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"ani","verse_key":"16:123"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱتَّبِعْ","en_gloss":"You follow","transliteration":"ittabiʿ","verse_key":"16:123"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِلَّةَ","en_gloss":"(the) religion","transliteration":"millata","verse_key":"16:123"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"16:123"},{"pos":8,"ar":"حَنِيفًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"upright","transliteration":"ḥanīfan","verse_key":"16:123"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"16:123"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"he was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"16:123"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"16:123"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_gloss":"the polytheists","transliteration":"l-mush'rikīna","verse_key":"16:123"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٢٣","en_gloss":"(123)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:123"}]},{"verse_key":"16:124","surah":16,"ayah":124,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا جُعِلَ ٱلسَّبْتُ عَلَى ٱلَّذِينَ ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟ فِيهِ ۚ وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَيَحْكُمُ بَيْنَهُمْ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ فِيمَا كَانُوا۟ فِيهِ يَخْتَلِفُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The Sabbath was made obligatory only for those who differed about it. On the Day of Resurrection your Lord will judge between them as to their differences.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جُعِلَ","en_gloss":"was appointed","transliteration":"juʿila","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّبْتُ","en_gloss":"the Sabbath","transliteration":"l-sabtu","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟","en_gloss":"differed","transliteration":"ikh'talafū","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِيهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَبَّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbaka","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَيَحْكُمُ","en_gloss":"will surely judge","transliteration":"layaḥkumu","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمْ","en_gloss":"between them","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on) the Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِيمَا","en_gloss":"in what","transliteration":"fīmā","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used (to)","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"[in it]","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يَخْتَلِفُونَ","en_gloss":"differ","transliteration":"yakhtalifūna","verse_key":"16:124"},{"pos":18,"ar":"١٢٤","en_gloss":"(124)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:124"}]},{"verse_key":"16:125","surah":16,"ayah":125,"ar_uthmani":"ٱدْعُ إِلَىٰ سَبِيلِ رَبِّكَ بِٱلْحِكْمَةِ وَٱلْمَوْعِظَةِ ٱلْحَسَنَةِ ۖ وَجَـٰدِلْهُم بِٱلَّتِى هِىَ أَحْسَنُ ۚ إِنَّ رَبَّكَ هُوَ أَعْلَمُ بِمَن ضَلَّ عَن سَبِيلِهِۦ ۖ وَهُوَ أَعْلَمُ بِٱلْمُهْتَدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], call [people] to the way of your Lord with wisdom and good teaching. Argue with them in the most courteous way, for your Lord knows best who has strayed from His way and who is rightly guided.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱدْعُ","en_gloss":"Call","transliteration":"ud'ʿu","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":3,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبِّكَ","en_gloss":"(of) your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱلْحِكْمَةِ","en_gloss":"with the wisdom","transliteration":"bil-ḥik'mati","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْمَوْعِظَةِ","en_gloss":"and the instruction","transliteration":"wal-mawʿiẓati","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْحَسَنَةِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the good","transliteration":"l-ḥasanati","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَجَـٰدِلْهُم","en_gloss":"and discuss with them","transliteration":"wajādil'hum","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"in that","transliteration":"bi-allatī","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هِىَ","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"hiya","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَحْسَنُ ۚ","en_gloss":"(is) best","transliteration":"aḥsanu","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":13,"ar":"رَبَّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbaka","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":14,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"(is) most knowing","transliteration":"aʿlamu","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بِمَن","en_gloss":"of who","transliteration":"biman","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ضَلَّ","en_gloss":"has strayed","transliteration":"ḍalla","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":18,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":19,"ar":"سَبِيلِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"His way","transliteration":"sabīlihi","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":21,"ar":"أَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"(is) most knowing","transliteration":"aʿlamu","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":22,"ar":"بِٱلْمُهْتَدِينَ","en_gloss":"of the guided ones","transliteration":"bil-muh'tadīna","verse_key":"16:125"},{"pos":23,"ar":"١٢٥","en_gloss":"(125)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:125"}]},{"verse_key":"16:126","surah":16,"ayah":126,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِنْ عَاقَبْتُمْ فَعَاقِبُوا۟ بِمِثْلِ مَا عُوقِبْتُم بِهِۦ ۖ وَلَئِن صَبَرْتُمْ لَهُوَ خَيْرٌ لِّلصَّـٰبِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you [believers] have to respond to an attack, make your response proportionate, but it is best to stand fast.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِنْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"16:126"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَاقَبْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you retaliate","transliteration":"ʿāqabtum","verse_key":"16:126"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَعَاقِبُوا۟","en_gloss":"then retaliate","transliteration":"faʿāqibū","verse_key":"16:126"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِمِثْلِ","en_gloss":"with the like","transliteration":"bimith'li","verse_key":"16:126"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"16:126"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عُوقِبْتُم","en_gloss":"you were afflicted","transliteration":"ʿūqib'tum","verse_key":"16:126"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"with [it]","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"16:126"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَئِن","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"wala-in","verse_key":"16:126"},{"pos":9,"ar":"صَبَرْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you are patient","transliteration":"ṣabartum","verse_key":"16:126"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَهُوَ","en_gloss":"surely (it) is","transliteration":"lahuwa","verse_key":"16:126"},{"pos":11,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"better","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"16:126"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِّلصَّـٰبِرِينَ","en_gloss":"for those who are patient","transliteration":"lilṣṣābirīna","verse_key":"16:126"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٢٦","en_gloss":"(126)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:126"}]},{"verse_key":"16:127","surah":16,"ayah":127,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱصْبِرْ وَمَا صَبْرُكَ إِلَّا بِٱللَّهِ ۚ وَلَا تَحْزَنْ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا تَكُ فِى ضَيْقٍ مِّمَّا يَمْكُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So [Prophet] be steadfast: your steadfastness comes only from God. Do not grieve over them; do not be distressed by their scheming,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱصْبِرْ","en_gloss":"And be patient","transliteration":"wa-iṣ'bir","verse_key":"16:127"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"16:127"},{"pos":3,"ar":"صَبْرُكَ","en_gloss":"(is) your patience","transliteration":"ṣabruka","verse_key":"16:127"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"16:127"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"from Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"16:127"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"16:127"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَحْزَنْ","en_gloss":"grieve","transliteration":"taḥzan","verse_key":"16:127"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"over them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"16:127"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"16:127"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَكُ","en_gloss":"be","transliteration":"taku","verse_key":"16:127"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"16:127"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ضَيْقٍۢ","en_gloss":"distress","transliteration":"ḍayqin","verse_key":"16:127"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِّمَّا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"16:127"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَمْكُرُونَ","en_gloss":"they plot","transliteration":"yamkurūna","verse_key":"16:127"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٢٧","en_gloss":"(127)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:127"}]},{"verse_key":"16:128","surah":16,"ayah":128,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ مَعَ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱتَّقَوا۟ وَّٱلَّذِينَ هُم مُّحْسِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"for God is with those who are mindful of Him and who do good.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"16:128"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"16:128"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَعَ","en_gloss":"(is) with","transliteration":"maʿa","verse_key":"16:128"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"16:128"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱتَّقَوا۟","en_gloss":"fear (Him)","transliteration":"ittaqaw","verse_key":"16:128"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَّٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"and those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"16:128"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هُم","en_gloss":"[they]","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"16:128"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُّحْسِنُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) good-doers","transliteration":"muḥ'sinūna","verse_key":"16:128"},{"pos":9,"ar":"١٢٨","en_gloss":"(128)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:128"}]}]}